      "message": "Engineering notes (accessibility severity included, if this is missing): \n1. {S2} Ensure the combobox has accessible name. In this case, use the on-screen \"Choose your email service\" string (either as `<label>` or with `aria-labelledby` on the `<select>` element itself referring to its `id`\n2. {S2-s3} If not `<select>` element will be used, ensure to follow the WAI Combobox pattern\n3. {s2} the logo image would need to have appropriate text alternative. I'd lean to mark them as decorative, but this is up to @Josh Berman",
