      "created_at": "2024-01-26T21:04:19.871Z",
      "resolved_at": null,
      "message": "Engineering notes (accessibility severity included, if this is missing): \n1. {s2-s3} Ensure to follow the WAI Dialog design pattern: (a) {s3} the container to be `role=\"dialog\"` and (b) {s3} have `aria-labelledby` set to the `id` of the heading element \"Send email...\", (c) {s4} it could also have `aria-describedby` set to the `id` of the inner container, so it'll still all be announced - the content is short enough for that; (d) {S2} move the focus to the dialog's first control or, ideally, add `tabindex=\"-1\"` to the dialog container and place the focus on it, when dialog opens;\n2. {s4} on-screen label is a heading, `<h1>` or `<h2>`",
      "reactions": [],
